      <title>Explainer: Simplified Income Tax Act, 2025, To Come into Force from April 1</title>
      <link>https://www.deccanchronicle.com/nation/explainer-simplified-income-tax-act-2025-to-come-into-force-from-april-1-1929762</link>
      <description>The new law simplifies the tax timeline by doing away with the distinction between the assessment year and the previous year, replacing it with a single 'tax year' framework. It also allows taxpayers to claim TDS refund even when ITRs are filed after deadlines, without any penal charges.</description>
